pan class=\"bullet\">Write a 120-180 word narrative about a detective.<br />\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use paragraph structure. Include 2-3 paragraphs.<br />\n<span class=\"bullet\">A narrative needs characters, a setting and a clear problem to be interesting to an audience. <br />\n\n<span class=\"bullet\">Step 1. Beginning:<br />\n<div class=indent>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Decide who is the narrator. (Who is speaking)  </li> \n<li>Choose the characters and the setting. (Where and When)</li>\n<li>Write the problem the detective faces.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Step 2. Middle: What happens?<br/>\n\n<span class=\"bullet\">Step 3. End: What is the solution to the problem or conflict?<br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the Go to <span class=\"strong\">Writing Task </span>button.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><br /><span class=\"strong\">My Short Narrative", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "You are done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">It's time to review your short narrative.</span><br />\n\nWhen you are writing your narrative, remember to:\n\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Use paragraph structure.</li>\n<li>Use tenses that you write when talking about the past.</li>\n<li>Include characters, a setting and events.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nProofread your narrative for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.<br />\n\nRead your narrative aloud to a partner.<br />\n\nClick the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span> button to save your work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "colspan": 1, "element": "th", "content