d yourself saying the sentences aloud.</span><span class=\"bullet\">Compare yourself to the audio.</span>\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 10, "type": "SR1"}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn8le03ob08re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Did you see that terrible crime on television last night?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le03ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le03ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le03ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100 ", "image": "engenn8le03ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p>Detective Johnson woke up to the phone ringing.<br/>\n\"There's been a double murder at 31 Marina Road. Come quickly,\" said the Sergeant.</p>\n<p>When Johnson arrived at the scene, the forensic people had already been there for an hour. They had dusted for fingerprints, and collected hair and blood samples from the carpet in the living room, where the murders had been committed. The samples were taken back to the lab by the team.</p>\n<p>Johnson walked over to the bodies. They were married hosts Tom and Mary from the popular \"Good Afternoon\" show. He had only seen them on television the day before.</p>"}, {"time": "36000", "image": "engenn8le03ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p>A gun lay near Mary's hand. Johnson could tell by the position of the body and the bullet hole in Tom's chest, that Mary had killed Tom. But who had killed Mary? There were pieces of a broken bottle on the ground. Mary had a big wound in the back of her head.</p>\n<p>Two days after the murders, the detective was called by the lab to say the results from the samples they had collected were ready.There were no usable fingerprints but they had found blood samples that didn't belong to Tom or Mary.<br/>\nAlso, they determined that some DNA partially matched Tom's. That meant that the killer was probably one of Tom's relatives! He got right onto the investigative work.</p>"}, {"time": "80500", "image": "engenn8le03ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<p>Tom's father was dead and he didn't have siblings. That left only his mother. She had lived down the street from Tom and Mary for years. When the police arrived at her door, they found her very distraught. She confessed that when she arrived at their house that day, she found Tom and Mary arguing about money. Mary was threatening to kill him. When Tom's mother heard Mary threatening her son, she took a bottle and smashed it over Mary's head. The gun went off and killed Tom by accident.</p><p>Tom's mother was remanded into custody by Johnson. What a tragic end for these public figures.</p>"}]}}]}, {"type": "video", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "7000", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> What does a narrative need?</span>"}, {"time": "92000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Which verbs do you often use in a narrative?</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn8le3ob08re3vid01"}}], "id": 2}]}], "type": "sena"}